# Naming

Build-order labels (`Phase 0`, `Phase 3`, …) belong in the spec pack and the
plan only. They are **not** crate, program, module, file, test, IDL, keypair,
or report names.

```text
❌ programs/phase0_probe
❌ tests/phase3_ctoken.ts
❌ reports/phase0-cu.json
❌ describe("phase0 token-2022 …")

✅ programs/token2022_probe
✅ tests/ctoken.ts
✅ reports/finalize-cu.json
✅ describe("token-2022 NonTransferable / PDA mint-burn")
```

`ping` stubs name the program (Factory, Vesting, DAO). They do not say which
plan phase will fill them in.
